  "steps": [
    "Loaded 891 passengers and extracted the title (Mr, Mrs, Miss, Master, rare) from each name.",
    "Filled missing ages with the median age of the same title, learned on the training split only.",
    "Engineered family size, travelling-alone flag and log fare per person inside the pipeline (a custom transformer with its own ONNX converter, so the browser computes the same features).",
    "Compared Logistic Regression, Random Forest and Gradient Boosting with 5\u00d73 repeated stratified CV.",
    "Picked Gradient Boosting by ROC-AUC and evaluated it once on a held-out 20% test set.",
    "Exported the whole pipeline to ONNX so it runs in the browser \u2014 no server needed."
  ],
